          "short": "$(2x+1)(3x+2)$",
          "worked": "$3\\times4=12$ and $3+4=7$.\n$$\\begin{align*}6x^2+7x+2&=6x^2+3x+4x+2\\\\6x^2+7x+2&=3x(2x+1)+2(2x+1)\\\\6x^2+7x+2&=(2x+1)(3x+2)\\end{align*}$$",
